:: Chapter1.0
<<nobr>>
    <div class="titleParent">
        <p class="titleTop">Beginning of</p>
        <p class="titleBottom">Departure</p>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Let's go!->Chapter1.1]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.1
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 1</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>Suddenly the rain stops, and you experience a slightly warmer wind, that lifts your hopes and gives you more desire to complete the trip, as you have set out to do.</p>
            <p>However, the sun didn’t last for long, and in the next 10 minutes, it started raining yet again.</p>
            <p>Luckily for you, you are already close to the main terminal, and aren’t affected much by the tremendous amount of water that just fell from the sky.</p>
            <p><i>“Well that was lucky”</i>, you mumbled.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter1.2]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.2
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 2</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <hr>
            <p><i>“Widerøe flight 285 to Bergen, operated by Norwegian, is now boarding at Gate 2,”</i></p>
            <hr>
            <br>
            <p>came loudly over the terminal intercom.<i>“Here we go,”</i> you said to yourself, heading toward the gate.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter1.3]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>


:: Chapter1.3
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 3</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>Unlike on any flights before, you had a strange feeling.</p>
            <p>You couldn’t describe it, it wasn’t something you knew what it was.</p>
            <p>There was one thing clear however.</p>
            <p>From now on, there is no turning back.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter1.4]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.4
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 4</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>The large B737 had just made a sharp turn onto the runway to backtrack and prepare for the takeoff.</p>
            <p>CFM engines spooled up loudly as the plane began accelerating to a high-speed taxi.</p>
            <p> Severe weather and flooded runway were shaking the plane heavily.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter1.5]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.5
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 5</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>Next to you, sat an elderly man.</p>
            <p>Clearly, he wasn’t so excited about the flight. </p>
            <p>His face was trembling with an expression you’ve never seen before in your whole life. </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Help the man->Chapter1.5_help]]
        </div>
        <div class="button">
            [[Ignore->Chapter1.5_ignore]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.5_help
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 5 (HELP)</p>
        </div>
        <<set $trust to $trust + 10>>
        <<set $stress to $stress + 5>>
        <<set $hope to $hope + 5>>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>You know what it feels like to drown in panic. Reaching out to him, you tap him on the shoulder. He jumps, turning his eyes full of fear to you.</p>
            <p><i>“It’s just some light precipitation”</i>, you said, hopefully easing the mans nerves.</p>
            <p><i> “Pilots deal with this stuff every day. Even better, we are flying in a much more reliable aircraft now.”</i>. The man nodded, and turned his face forwards. The fear was slowly draining from his expression.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter1.6]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.5_ignore
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 5 (IGNORE)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>Despite his expression, you look away, turning your face to a window which was really blurry, due to all the rain.</p>
            <p>You have enough of your own problems on your shoulders to carry tonight. You cannot afford to take another man’s problems on yourself.</p>
            <p>You throw the headphones onto your head and turn on some music, to silence any cries of the passengers.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter1.6]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.6
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 6</p>
        </div>

        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p><i>“Nordic 248, Faroe tower, Wind 280 degrees at 20 knots, gusting to 28 kts, fly runway heading, runway 30 cleared for takeoff”</i>, was slightly audible from the cockpit. The same moment, the 2 CFM engines roared to life, and the plane started accelerating rapidly down a flooded runway. </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter1.7]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.7
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 7</p>
        </div>

        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>As the wings gained authority, the whole plane was jolted to the side with the sudden gust of crosswind, and for a moment, it appeared as if the engine cowling had actually striked the asphalt underneath. </p>
            <p>No sparks, no fire. Just the cowling was ever so slightly deformed. </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter1.8]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.8
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 8</p>
        </div>

        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>Despite the incident, the pilots continued the takeoff, as if nothing had happened. Presumably, they haven’t even noticed the impact.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Report the damage->Chapter1.9_report]]
        </div>
        <div class="button">
            [[Stay quiet->Chapter1.9_ignore]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.9_report
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 9 (REPORT)</p>
        </div>
        <<set $knowledge to $knowledge + 1>>
        <<set $trust to $trust + 5>>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>As soon as the plane was in a level flight and had gained some altitude, you swiftly unbuckled your seatbelt, and sprung to the front galley to report the damage to the flight attendants. </p>
            <p><i>“On the takeoff roll, the right engine cowling had struck the asphalt, and appeared slightly deformed”</i>, you said to the flight attendants. </p>
            <p><i>“Thanks for reporting, we will report that to the captain. Now return to your seat and make sure your seatbelt is fastened”</i>. You went back to your seat, with your mind slightly eased.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter1.10]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.9_ignore
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 9 (IGNORE)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>You instantly imagined all of the dangerous scenarios that could have happened. </p>
            <p>Your mind was filled with terrifying thoughts, and wasn’t giving you the peace of mind that you should’ve had on this short hop from Faroe to Bergen. </p>
            <p>The slight vibration that the engine was now causing wasn’t particularly of your liking. </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Continue->Chapter1.10]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>

:: Chapter1.10
<<nobr>>
    <div class="storyContainer">
        <div class="Subtitle">
            <p>Chapter1 - 10</p>
        </div>

        <div class="StoryMain">
            <p>Plane continued climbing loudly through the clouds for another 30 or 40 minutes. </p>
            <p>It was hard to tell because you had absolutely zero visual clue.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buttonsParent">
        <div class="button">
            [[Lost In Storm->Chapter2.0]]
        </div>
    </div>
<</nobr>>
